  "question": {
    "text": "The acceleration experienced by a moving boat after is engine is cut-off, is given by <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi>k</mi></math> is a constant. If <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> is the magnitude of velocity at cut-off, then the magnitude of the velocity at time <math><mi>t</mi></math> after the cut off is",
